{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":949197,\"title\":\"Človek na moste\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"At the beginning of normalization, stories emphasizing civic awareness once again prevailed. The hero here is a teacher from a small village in the foothills, whose inhabitants help the partisans in their fight against fascism. The hero, the only intellectual among them, agrees with them and educates not only his students in this spirit, but is also prepared to lay down his life for his ideals. When German soldiers occupy the village and force the teacher to cooperate, the model situation escalates.\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":1972,\"runtime\":0,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"XC\",\"name\":\"Czechoslovakia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Ján Lacko\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":137037,\"name\":\"Ján Lacko\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":236626,\"name\":\"Ivan Mistrík\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9d6ksxXbz8IlGMnLgANSyP6qjns.jpg\"},{\"id\":1199664,\"name\":\"Adam Matejka\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A4IpUlyIkLFJKpy0nEufyz2OBjQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1262110,\"name\":\"Leopold Haverl\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8g2hYM1Bu0mllTxqHVlMWmPHGRA.jpg\"},{\"id\":2108954,\"name\":\"Jozef Hodorovský\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1132478,\"name\":\"Eduard Bindas\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7yBdYGYduOdxbHAnb0KgvIA4gu4.jpg\"},{\"id\":3684446,\"name\":\"Daniela Kubasáková\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1132538,\"name\":\"Slavo Drozd\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1737853,\"name\":\"Vladimír Petruška\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2993482,\"name\":\"Ján Ivančo\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1334707,\"name\":\"Mária Markovičová\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1082909,\"name\":\"Oľga Vronská\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1432129,\"name\":\"Rudolf Bachlet\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2726826,\"name\":\"Xénia Gracová\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2069803,\"name\":\"Emília Haľamová\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3464469,\"name\":\"Stanislav Mičinec\",\"character\":\"Boy\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":872585,\"title\":\"Oppenheimer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer's role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":16869,\"title\":\"Inglourious Basterds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aupnPtagH9JVBuMrGEanf4iqXEQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bMJxwgLyD47CDQ6BFCT2AMMlID7.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as \\\"The Basterds\\\" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324786,\"title\":\"Hacksaw Ridge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fnOMP6mjmOmZwmlC1n0K7ivrzt1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vDKRMZGFTKP9nQolzeSB1rB1w6p.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"WWII American Army Medic Desmond T. Doss, who served during the Battle of Okinawa, refuses to kill people and becomes the first Conscientious Objector in American history to receive the Congressional Medal of Honor.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":423,\"title\":\"The Pianist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy7yum0GKRi3Y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c0fB9xk7D1aVb3Bg2rk2SVJcGn.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman's experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":228150,\"title\":\"Fury\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pfte7wdMobMF4CVHuOxyu6oqeeA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/95ckrV6wQgbffurAVmETQ5YKASL.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"April, 1945. As the Allies make their final push in the European Theater, a battle-hardened army sergeant commands a Sherman tank with a five-man crew on a deadly mission behind enemy lines.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":205596,\"title\":\"The Imitation Game\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSqJ1qFq8NXFfi7JeIYMlzyR0dx.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8FCHJ21JBQOgATY2WI8vwYAiXg8.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Based on the real life story of legendary cryptanalyst Alan Turing, the film portrays the nail-biting race against time by Turing and his brilliant team of code-breakers at Britain's top-secret Government Code and Cypher School at Bletchley Park, during the darkest days of World War II.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14574,\"title\":\"The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6aRuABAdhuuDypLGscM7HoEWHx4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel's fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp's walls.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":676,\"title\":\"Pearl Harbor\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/giWL3kIA5E67VUTWY1PkfHgyZ1B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zv1xOEQzebKyku349qDZ085FZlO.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The lifelong friendship between Rafe McCawley and Danny Walker is put to the ultimate test when the two ace fighter pilots become entangled in a love triangle with beautiful Naval nurse Evelyn Johnson. But the rivalry between the friends-turned-foes is immediately put on hold when they find themselves at the center of Japan's devastating attack on Pearl Harbor on Dec. 7, 1941.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":515001,\"title\":\"Jojo Rabbit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1mqL7VG4Ix8wmxwypmCA1HTHBky.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lTyikzfGgRX5ZqIfVeT26APYfRL.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jojo, a lonely German boy during World War II has his world shaken when he learns that his single mother is hiding a Jewish girl in their home. Influenced by a buffoonish imaginary version of Adolf Hitler, he begins to question his beliefs and confront the conflict between propaganda and his own humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"War\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":467244,\"title\":\"The Zone of Interest\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hUu9zyZmDd8VZegKi1iK1Vk0RYS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pnTSOKcYnvdpQNQElAtJM1rWOxH.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The commandant of Auschwitz, Rudolf Höss, and his wife Hedwig, strive to build a dream life for their family in a house and garden next to the camp.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":516486,\"title\":\"Greyhound\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kjMbDciooTbJPofVXgAoFjfX8Of.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXBnM6uSTk6qqCf0SRZKXcga9Ba.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A first-time captain leads a convoy of allied ships carrying thousands of soldiers across the treacherous waters of the \\\"Black Pit\\\" to the front lines of WWII. With no air cover protection for 5 days, the captain and his convoy must battle the surrounding enemy Nazi U-boats in order to give the allies a chance to win the war.\",\"genres\":[\"War\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":2253,\"title\":\"Valkyrie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8eoRtXswC8IQDsqW7iJWO56NhAv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1F7cnW3Tf8IDJO64MxtuPhHDcQp.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Wounded in Africa during World War II, Nazi Col. Claus von Stauffenberg returns to his native Germany and joins the Resistance in a daring plan to create a shadow government and assassinate Adolf Hitler. When events unfold so that he becomes a central player, he finds himself tasked with both leading the coup and personally killing the Führer.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Thriller\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"T5IyJTGyBjk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3Cx3icFK3dY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nZ-_P3j_vdw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}